  "content": "[Intro]\n[A]\n\n[Verse]\n[A]So no one told\nyou life was\ngonna be this\n[G]way\n[A]Your job's a joke,\nyou're broke, your\nlove life's D.O.A.\n[C#m]\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[G]It's like you're al\n[Bm]ways stuck in se\n[A]cond gear\nWhen it\n[G]hasn't been your day,\n[D/F#]your week, your month,\n[E]or even your\nyear, but\n\n[Chorus]\n[A]I'll be\n[Dsus2]there for you\n[E](When the\nrain starts to pour)\n[A]I'll be\n[Dsus2]there for you\n[E](Like I've\nbeen there before)\n[A]I'll be\n[Dsus2]there for you\n[E]('Cause you're\nthere for me too)\n\n[Outro]\n[G]\n[A]",
